{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:00d60e31a4e6b834","name":"Run","source":{"id":"source:reference-00d60e31a4e6b834","title":"Run","revision":18461,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:10:05Z","sha256":"03a04840acba8116c2af9703fb4f99a2ab788c234afa151f4bd5cd652daeed9e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18461","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Run&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-00d60e31a4e6b834","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can Run as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". When you Run, you can move up to four times your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," in a straight line (or three times your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," in a straight line if you are wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"}," or carrying a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Load"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Load"},").\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You lose any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," while you're Running, since you can't actively avoid attacks. You can Run for a number of rounds equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score without any trouble. If you want to continue Running after that, you must succeed on a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," check. You must check again each round in which you continue to Run, and the DC of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," check increases by 1 for each previous check you made.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you fail a check, you move -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". You can only remove this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," by resting for the same length of time that you were Running. During this rest period, you can only ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," at your normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Hard March"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Field Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Field_Commander","referenceId":"reference:5ad8d1c0fe6dab83"}," can move the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," up to 4 times its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," until the beginning of the Field Commander's next turn. An ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Leader","referenceId":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153"}," cannot order the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to make attacks until the end of the Field Commander's next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
